<title>INDIA: India's 96/97 cardamom output at 7,500 T vs same.</title>
<headline>India's 96/97 cardamom output at 7,500 T vs same.</headline>
<dateline>COONOOR, India 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Planters Association of Southern India (UPASI), in a note prepared for a planters conference, forecast the cardamom crop in 1996/97 (Aug-July) at 7,500 tonnes, the same as in the previous year.</p>
<p>&quot;Good weather conditions favoured the crops in 1996/97,&quot; an UPASI official.</p>
</text>
